336
00:39:23,720 --> 00:39:27,720
So the condition property did not look that good.

337
00:39:27,720 --> 00:39:32,720
So when I saw the notice, they reacted to get everything shaped up and clean.

338
00:39:32,720 --> 00:39:34,720
They have a nice picture of it.

339
00:39:34,720 --> 00:39:41,720
