340
00:39:41,720 --> 00:39:45,720
So the date was missed, but the property was clean.

341
00:39:45,720 --> 00:39:57,720
So when we got the notice of 242 dollars to pay for the area, which is 10 by 25 yards to cut for 242, they called the office.

342
00:39:57,720 --> 00:40:01,720
They said, well, if you cut it, 242 is not reasonable anyway.

343
00:40:01,720 --> 00:40:09,720
And plus, it was really negligence on my part, not really in the whole citation.

344
00:40:09,720 --> 00:40:16,720
So at this point, I really feel that if I pay 242.66, it's not going to really destroy my economic condition.

345
00:40:16,720 --> 00:40:23,720
But I really feel that it's not really fair that the situation, that everything written embedded together.

346
00:40:23,720 --> 00:40:29,720
So I'm glad to have this opportunity to show up and tell you about my case.

347
00:40:29,720 --> 00:40:30,720
Thank you.

348
00:40:30,720 --> 00:40:32,720
Thank you, sir, for your comments.

349
00:40:32,720 --> 00:40:35,720
Are there anyone else who wishes to comment?

350
00:40:35,720 --> 00:40:38,720
Seeing none, the public hearing is closed.

