00:40:38,720 --> 00:40:43,720
Is there a motion to approve the resolution motion from Mr. second from Mr. Kling?

352
00:40:43,720 --> 00:40:45,720
Second from Mr. Little.

353
00:40:45,720 --> 00:40:50,720
Council members, do we have any questions for Mr. Irwin?

