00:50:16,720 --> 00:50:18,720
Why would we want to do that?

446
00:50:18,720 --> 00:50:30,720
One, it abuts the existing west runway and the master plan of the airport and from an industrial recruitment, we have lost significant projects that need access to a runway.

447
00:50:30,720 --> 00:50:37,720
The reason we've lost those projects is not due to workforce, not due to great projects and project sites and great utilities.

448
00:50:37,720 --> 00:50:43,720
It's been the delay that you would have to relocate County Line Road before someone could make that private investment.

449
00:50:43,720 --> 00:50:48,720
So we think it's the opportunity under this TIF to go ahead and move it to its permanent home.

450
00:50:48,720 --> 00:50:52,720
Our long-term transportation plan is to move County Line Road west.

451
00:50:52,720 --> 00:50:55,720
It is the long-term plan of Huntsville International Airport, too.

452
00:50:55,720 --> 00:50:58,720
So we're following a plan that's been in place.

453
00:50:58,720 --> 00:51:06,720
We now believe through this process we have the funds, should this get approved, to go ahead and complete that infrastructure improvement.

454
00:51:06,720 --> 00:51:14,720
As I just mentioned, a new K-8 Elementary School in partnership with Huntsville City Schools at $40 million upgrades to Fire Station 18.

