00:51:22,720 --> 00:51:28,720
It would allow our fire department to add a ladder truck, which is very much needed in this industrial corridor.

457
00:51:28,720 --> 00:51:35,720
And then multiple sanitary sewer improvements throughout that district to entice new private investment.

458
00:51:35,720 --> 00:51:42,720
And then the last is the 21st century manufacturing zone land.

