651
01:09:35,720 --> 01:09:41,720
By state law, a TIF district, all the land within that district must be within our seat limits.

652
01:09:41,720 --> 01:09:45,720
Yes, you actually see some areas that says the word out.

653
01:09:45,720 --> 01:09:48,720
You may not be able to see it at that scale.

654
01:09:48,720 --> 01:09:49,720
Those are carved out.

655
01:09:49,720 --> 01:09:54,720
So if you look at the exhibit of this plan, you've got a very long legal description.

656
01:09:54,720 --> 01:09:56,720
It's about four pages.

657
01:09:56,720 --> 01:10:00,720
But then it's got what we call less than except where we are carving out those pieces

658
01:10:00,720 --> 01:10:03,720
that are not inside the seat limits of Huntsville.

659
01:10:03,720 --> 01:10:08,720
So only the land that's within our corporate limits.

660
01:10:08,720 --> 01:10:10,720
