675
01:10:52,720 --> 01:10:57,720
If you've looked at most of our TIFs, we have tried to put an educational component

676
01:10:57,720 --> 01:10:58,720
where it makes sense.

677
01:10:58,720 --> 01:11:00,720
We've done some TIFs like the one downtown.

678
01:11:00,720 --> 01:11:05,720
We are helping with a new school over on Lowe, the new middle school.

679
01:11:05,720 --> 01:11:07,720
But that project was underway.

680
01:11:07,720 --> 01:11:12,720
So we're helping with public infrastructure in and around that school to make it safer

681
01:11:12,720 --> 01:11:13,720
