682
01:11:13,720 --> 01:11:19,720
And that's taking away from the school system's budget that they would have had to go do that, right?

683
01:11:19,720 --> 01:11:25,720
So if you go look at the history of our TIFs, where we've been able to contribute,

684
01:11:25,720 --> 01:11:30,720
if that TIF district has had a school or the school system has in the future said,

685
01:11:30,720 --> 01:11:35,720
this is where we want a school, we've tried to help our educational partners always.

686
01:11:35,720 --> 01:11:37,720
