863
01:24:32,720 --> 01:24:44,720
The first time I was there was about 25 years ago was when the 9-11 tragedy happened when people rammed airplanes into buildings in New York City and Washington D.C.

864
01:24:44,720 --> 01:24:47,720
and crashed a plane in Pennsylvania.

865
01:24:47,720 --> 01:24:51,720
It's one of those things that our country looks back on.

866
01:24:51,720 --> 01:25:03,720
For 25 years we've looked back on this and this ceremony has been taking place for 25 years so that we can remember those and memorialize those who lost their lives in that.

867
01:25:03,720 --> 01:25:18,720
