924
01:31:26,720 --> 01:31:37,720
And it's going to be in retail, restaurants, gathering spaces, and most importantly, a variety of housing options that support residents in that area at every stage of their life.

925
01:31:37,720 --> 01:31:46,720
I also had the opportunity to participate in the medal award ceremony during the UCI Para Cycling World Championships last weekend.

926
01:31:46,720 --> 01:31:54,720
It was a unique opportunity that I am grateful to the Chamber and the Research Park Board for inviting me to serve in that function,

927
01:31:54,720 --> 01:32:02,720
which was an opportunity to not only meet but interact with some truly wonderful athletes from all over the world.

928
01:32:03,720 --> 01:32:16,720
I will be hosting a community forum on flock cameras here in the council chambers next Wednesday, September 16th at 4 p.m.

929
01:32:16,720 --> 01:32:29,720
The guests will be HPD Chief Kirk Giles and North Alabama Multi-Agency Crime Center or NAMAC Director Kurt Worsick.

930
01:32:29,720 --> 01:32:36,720
And the public, as always when it comes to the forums I host, is invited to be here,

931
01:32:36,720 --> 01:32:45,720
hear from the issue or subject matter experts, and ask any questions that they might have of those experts.

932
01:32:45,720 --> 01:32:55,720
So I look forward to a very entertaining and informative forum next week.

933
01:32:55,720 --> 01:33:05,720
And I certainly hope that the myriad of people that have been pounding me and I'm sure my colleagues on flock cameras actually show up

934
01:33:05,720 --> 01:33:11,720
and on the record have their questions answered by those experts.

935
01:33:11,720 --> 01:33:18,720
I'd also like to announce the District 5 Town Hall next Thursday, September 17th.

936
01:33:18,720 --> 01:33:27,720
That will be at 6 p.m. at the New Hope Cumberland Presbyterian Church on Wall Street in Madison, Alabama.

937
01:33:27,720 --> 01:33:33,720
Technically it's Madison, Alabama. That's a mailing address, but it's definitely the city of Huntsville.

938
01:33:33,720 --> 01:33:43,720
And we will delve a little bit deeper into some of the development that will be happening in their neighborhoods.

939
01:33:44,720 --> 01:33:52,720
Finally, brings me to something I have been pondering for quite a while.

940
01:33:52,720 --> 01:34:01,720
And it's a difficult decision that I've had to make because I know that certain people are going to paint me as being difficult.

941
01:34:01,720 --> 01:34:05,720
They're going to classify me or call me a bomb thrower.

942
01:34:06,720 --> 01:34:20,720
But after much prayer, I think it's important to hold this council to following the rules that we are supposed to be operating under.

943
01:34:20,720 --> 01:34:26,720
A special session of the council was called by President Robinson for September 18th.

944
01:34:26,720 --> 01:34:38,720
And it was published on the council agenda page of the city of Huntsville's website for a presentation of the FY 27 annual budget by the administration.

945
01:34:38,720 --> 01:34:46,720
I was prepared to hear that presentation and at that time offer any amendments I or my colleagues might have.

946
01:34:46,720 --> 01:34:54,720
However, I was informed by President Robinson and an email to the entire council that after meeting with the administration,

947
01:34:54,720 --> 01:34:59,720
to review the reorganization chart in the fire and police pay raise,

948
01:34:59,720 --> 01:35:08,720
she believed it would not be appropriate to hold a special session to review the budget and other matters.

949
01:35:08,720 --> 01:35:22,720
And as a result, the council would hold a work session on September 18th to provide an opportunity to review the budget and the impact of the reorganization and raises on the budget.

950
01:35:22,720 --> 01:35:32,720
She mentioned later in that email that she did not think we would rush through action or should rush through action on the budget or the new staff structure.

951
01:35:32,720 --> 01:35:41,720
This explanation left me not being able to understand the full extent of what was to be presented at this work session.

952
01:35:41,720 --> 01:35:46,720
She had evidently just decided to switch from a special session.

953
01:35:46,720 --> 01:35:51,720
Indeed, what the.

954
01:35:51,720 --> 01:35:58,720
This was not according to state law in Alabama.

955
01:35:58,720 --> 01:36:10,720
There was no mention in the email I received concerning that this council needed to make sure that we were fully transparent with the public and the need for a careful review of public transparency.

956
01:36:11,720 --> 01:36:20,720
I believe all my constituents know that I am certainly an advocate for transparency for public matters, all public matters,

957
01:36:20,720 --> 01:36:28,720
as well as anyone who knows me is well aware that I play by the rules and I insist that others play by the rules.

958
01:36:28,720 --> 01:36:36,720
Perhaps transparency that she has talked about should begin with this council or at least myself.

959
01:36:36,720 --> 01:36:45,720
Because I cannot speak for my other colleagues here because I'm not privy to what conversations they had with the president.

960
01:36:45,720 --> 01:36:50,720
From my understanding of the proper rules for conducting business and the Alabama law,

961
01:36:50,720 --> 01:37:01,720
I do not believe the president of the council has the authority to arbitrarily change a called and published special session of the council to a work session with other members of the council.

962
01:37:01,720 --> 01:37:10,720
And as far as I am aware, and certainly not the opportunity to vote on the matter, if this was done from some sense of personal power or authority,

963
01:37:10,720 --> 01:37:20,720
I wish I which I don't believe the council president has and without following the rules or caring about my rights or the rights of other council members,

964
01:37:20,720 --> 01:37:25,720
it is a despicable act to have a special session of the council.

965
01:37:26,720 --> 01:37:37,720
As a result, I am formally requesting that the city's legal department issue a written legal opinion regarding whether the council president possesses the unilateral authority under Alabama code section 11-43-50

966
01:37:37,720 --> 01:37:46,720
and the Huntsville City Council rules to change a properly called and published special session into a non-voting work session over the formal objection of council member.

967
01:37:46,720 --> 01:37:55,720
And whether doing so complies with the public's decision to change the law or the law itself is a question of the council's decision to change the law.

968
01:37:55,720 --> 01:38:04,720
I would like to request that the council change a properly called and published special session into a non-voting work session over the formal objection of council member.

969
01:38:04,720 --> 01:38:11,720
And whether doing so complies with the public notice requirements of the Alabama Open Meetings Act.

970
01:38:11,720 --> 01:38:16,720
And I'd like that by close of business on September 17th.

971
01:38:16,720 --> 01:38:26,720
And while I know it cannot be had by next week, I would also request an inquiry of the attorney general's opinion on this matter.

972
01:38:29,720 --> 01:38:30,720
Thank you.

973
01:38:31,720 --> 01:38:36,720
Mr. Riley, will you please comply with that? You will comply with that.

974
01:38:37,720 --> 01:38:40,720
Thank you, sir. And we can have that by September 17th.

975
01:38:41,720 --> 01:38:42,720
Thank you, sir.

976
01:38:42,720 --> 01:38:47,720
Well, now we will hear from Ms. Watkins.

977
01:38:48,720 --> 01:38:49,720
Good evening, everyone.

978
01:38:50,720 --> 01:38:54,720
Last Thursday, I had the pleasure of going to Harris Home for Children.

979
01:38:55,720 --> 01:39:06,720
The Leo family Vulcan Corporation and other community members and volunteers came out for a ribbon cutting.

980
01:39:06,720 --> 01:39:15,720
The Leo family remodeled the gym and Vulcan went in and painted and bought furniture and decorated.

981
01:39:15,720 --> 01:39:26,720
And when I tell you it was so overwhelming to see the community come together to refurbish this facility, to make it look like a home for the residents.

982
01:39:26,720 --> 01:39:33,720
So I want to especially thank the Leo family and I want to thank Vulcan as well and the other community members that attended.

983
01:39:33,720 --> 01:39:34,720
Andy Warhol exhibit.

984
