I had the pleasure of going to CNN last Friday.

985
01:39:37,720 --> 01:39:40,720
If you have not went to see it, you need to.

986
01:39:40,720 --> 01:39:43,720
My favorite painting is one of Merlin Monroe.

987
01:39:43,720 --> 01:39:46,720
