988
01:39:47,720 --> 01:39:56,720
Today, I had the pleasure of attending a meeting at Happy Health and the administrator of the Health Resources and Services Administration.

989
01:39:56,720 --> 01:40:03,720
Mr. Tom Ingalls was in town to award them a six hundred and fifty thousand dollar grant that they applied for.

990
01:40:03,720 --> 01:40:06,720
Representative Holl was there.

991
01:40:06,720 --> 01:40:10,720
Commissioner Edwards as well as Congressman Dale Strong.

992
01:40:10,720 --> 01:40:18,720
It was a really big deal for Happy Health who are investing in our community and individuals who do not have insurance.

993
01:40:18,720 --> 01:40:20,720
I was very excited about that.

994
01:40:22,720 --> 01:40:25,720
Thank you, Susan Higgins, for sharing your story.

995
01:40:26,720 --> 01:40:33,720
And and I truly appreciate you being brave enough to come to the microphone and talk about your hearing aids.

996
01:40:33,720 --> 01:40:35,720
And I definitely support this.

997
01:40:35,720 --> 01:40:38,720
I support the effort to eliminate the tax.

998
01:40:38,720 --> 01:40:41,720
Some people cannot afford this.

999
01:40:41,720 --> 01:40:44,720
And I think this is something that we should support.

1000
01:40:44,720 --> 01:40:46,720
But I'm going to record saying I support it.

1001
01:40:46,720 --> 01:40:56,720
Also today, I had the pleasure this morning of wishing our best girlfriend, Tony Terrell, fond farewell on her last day on her radio show.

1002
01:40:56,720 --> 01:41:00,720
And it was so nice to see all the people that came out.

1003
01:41:00,720 --> 01:41:01,720
She has so many flowers.

1004
01:41:01,720 --> 01:41:03,720
I don't know how she's going to get a mental car.

1005
01:41:03,720 --> 01:41:05,720
And she had all kinds of treats.

1006
01:41:05,720 --> 01:41:07,720
And it was just great to see Tony.

1007
01:41:07,720 --> 01:41:11,720
We had her here a couple of weeks ago to recognize her for 20 years of service.

1008
01:41:11,720 --> 01:41:14,720
In the community, we had no idea that her time was coming to an end.

1009
01:41:14,720 --> 01:41:16,720
But I didn't tell Tony goodbye.

1010
01:41:16,720 --> 01:41:20,720
I told her until what's next, because Tony has a lot to offer this community.

1011
01:41:20,720 --> 01:41:23,720
I want to thank Miss Kathy Miller and your staff.

1012
01:41:23,720 --> 01:41:30,720
I want to thank the Madison County Commission, MPO, as well as anyone in the city of Huntsville that had any of the best services that they could offer.

1013
01:41:30,720 --> 01:41:32,720
And I want to thank you for that.

1014
01:41:33,720 --> 01:41:34,720
And your staff.

