2796
03:03:19,040 --> 03:03:22,920
I wanted to talk a little bit about racism,

2797
03:03:22,920 --> 03:03:24,120
racism in Huntsville,

2798
03:03:24,120 --> 03:03:26,440
and I wanted to show a little bit of support

2799
03:03:26,440 --> 03:03:30,320
for a Black History Museum to be installed in Huntsville.

2800
03:03:30,320 --> 03:03:33,360
I know that several people from Omega Psi Phi

2801
03:03:33,360 --> 03:03:35,860
have advocated that for some time now.

2802
03:03:37,920 --> 03:03:42,160
I remember a while back when there was racist graffiti

2803
03:03:42,160 --> 03:03:44,800
that was put on the mid-city mural,

2804
03:03:44,800 --> 03:03:46,840
if anybody here remembers that.

2805
03:03:46,840 --> 03:03:50,220
I remember watching them paint over that,

2806
03:03:50,220 --> 03:03:52,740
or hearing about them paint over that.

2807
03:03:52,740 --> 03:03:55,800
I remember hearing reports about restaurants

2808
03:03:55,800 --> 03:03:59,480
that had suffered verbal attacks, racist, vitriol.

2809
03:04:01,280 --> 03:04:04,000
I remember covering up,

2810
03:04:04,000 --> 03:04:05,640
this is I think when I was homeless,

2811
03:04:05,640 --> 03:04:07,680
and I did a lot of walking around in this city,

2812
03:04:07,680 --> 03:04:10,540
and I remember finding racist graffiti myself,

2813
03:04:10,540 --> 03:04:13,020
and with my own hands covering up racist graffiti

2814
03:04:13,020 --> 03:04:14,440
in this town.

2815
03:04:14,440 --> 03:04:18,180
I've watched one of our city council members,

2816
03:04:18,180 --> 03:04:20,260
John Meredith, make claims

2817
03:04:20,260 --> 03:04:22,860
about receiving discriminatory practice.

2818
03:04:23,740 --> 03:04:26,340
I remember when our councilwoman,

2819
03:04:26,340 --> 03:04:27,980
Michelle Watkins, first came on

2820
03:04:27,980 --> 03:04:31,100
and was on the receiving end of racist vitriol

2821
03:04:31,100 --> 03:04:34,620
via email, I believe, or some other communication,

2822
03:04:34,620 --> 03:04:37,700
and I remember reaching out to our councilwoman Watkins

2823
03:04:37,700 --> 03:04:38,540
about that.

2824
03:04:39,540 --> 03:04:42,220
These are examples of explicit,

2825
03:04:42,220 --> 03:04:44,980
outright, in our face racism.

2826
03:04:44,980 --> 03:04:47,800
We also have, there are systemic issues

2827
03:04:47,800 --> 03:04:51,060
that we had the Smithsonian come through

2828
03:04:51,060 --> 03:04:52,580
with the bias inside us,

2829
03:04:52,580 --> 03:04:55,420
and we kind of showed that value of seeing that

2830
03:04:55,420 --> 03:04:58,040
there is an implicit bias in all of us.

2831
03:05:02,140 --> 03:05:05,740
I have shared, there's an article,

2832
03:05:05,740 --> 03:05:07,660
I believe it's called the Expert Mechanism

2833
03:05:07,660 --> 03:05:11,700
on Racial Justice, it's a UN expert mechanism.

2834
03:05:11,700 --> 03:05:14,940
I remember sharing a document that came out of that

2835
03:05:14,940 --> 03:05:17,360
when they did a visit to the US,

2836
03:05:17,360 --> 03:05:18,700
and I remember sharing that document

2837
03:05:18,700 --> 03:05:20,220
with the entire council before.

2838
03:05:21,740 --> 03:05:26,660
These are examples of racism in our communities,

2839
03:05:26,660 --> 03:05:28,580
and history is not just something

2840
03:05:28,580 --> 03:05:31,020
that is represented in the past in museums,

2841
03:05:31,020 --> 03:05:32,740
it's also represented in the present

2842
03:05:32,740 --> 03:05:35,820
with our daily actions and our daily perceptions

2843
03:05:35,820 --> 03:05:38,660
that then shape the future, right, so it's important.

2844
03:05:40,460 --> 03:05:43,340
I wanted to call out a call for accountability

2845
03:05:43,340 --> 03:05:45,620
and say that I believe that our council member,

2846
03:05:45,620 --> 03:05:47,420
my council member, Bill Kling,

2847
03:05:47,420 --> 03:05:49,740
should recant statements that there is no racism

2848
03:05:49,740 --> 03:05:51,120
in Huntsville because I don't believe

2849
03:05:51,120 --> 03:05:53,320
that that was an appropriate comment to make.

2850
03:05:54,860 --> 03:05:55,700
Thank you, sir.

2851
03:05:55,700 --> 03:05:59,260
We will now hear from Liliana Painter,

2852
03:05:59,260 --> 03:06:01,060
who will be followed by Harold Kemp.

2853
03:06:05,820 --> 03:06:06,660
Please.

2854
03:06:18,740 --> 03:06:20,660
Good evening, council.

2855
03:06:20,660 --> 03:06:22,540
My name is Liliana Painter,

2856
03:06:22,540 --> 03:06:24,620
and my address is correct on the sheet.

2857
03:06:24,620 --> 03:06:26,000
City of Residence.

2858
03:06:26,000 --> 03:06:27,620
A city of residence is Huntsville.

2859
03:06:27,620 --> 03:06:28,580
Thank you.

2860
03:06:28,580 --> 03:06:33,180
I've called Madison County my home since 2014.

2861
03:06:33,180 --> 03:06:35,080
I've experienced Huntsville's growth

2862
03:06:35,080 --> 03:06:37,440
through several lenses, as a homeowner,

2863
03:06:37,440 --> 03:06:39,960
an educator, a small business owner,

2864
03:06:39,960 --> 03:06:43,460
and most importantly, a mother raising her children here.

2865
03:06:44,760 --> 03:06:47,140
I've watched our neighborhoods grow,

2866
03:06:48,140 --> 03:06:53,140
businesses come in, and more families choose Huntsville.

2867
03:06:53,600 --> 03:06:56,980
I believe growth is a good thing,

2868
03:06:56,980 --> 03:07:01,140
but we have to be intentional about who the growth serves.

2869
03:07:01,160 --> 03:07:05,280
Tonight, we're investing in our workforce,

2870
03:07:05,280 --> 03:07:08,440
considering hundreds of acres of development

2871
03:07:08,440 --> 03:07:11,040
and annexation, continuing to invite people

2872
03:07:11,040 --> 03:07:12,960
and businesses to choose Huntsville.

2873
03:07:14,100 --> 03:07:16,480
I support investing in our public servants,

2874
03:07:16,480 --> 03:07:19,660
but if we can find room in our budget

2875
03:07:19,660 --> 03:07:24,660
to address compensation, we should bring that same urgency

2876
03:07:25,120 --> 03:07:27,720
to affordability for our residents.

2877
03:07:27,820 --> 03:07:31,020
Tonight, we're finally considering eliminating

2878
03:07:31,020 --> 03:07:36,020
the city sales tax on something as essential as hearing aids.

2879
03:07:36,100 --> 03:07:39,100
So I would highly recommend thinking

2880
03:07:39,100 --> 03:07:41,500
about that more clearly.

2881
03:07:41,500 --> 03:07:46,500
We're also considering another 236 acres for annexation,

2882
03:07:46,500 --> 03:07:48,780
a new tax increment financing district,

2883
03:07:48,780 --> 03:07:52,420
and more than 800 acres moving through major zoning

2884
03:07:52,420 --> 03:07:54,500
and rezoning actions.

2885
03:07:54,880 --> 03:07:57,400
When we annex land to create a TIF district

2886
03:07:57,400 --> 03:07:59,480
or rezone hundreds of acres,

2887
03:07:59,480 --> 03:08:03,280
we aren't just moving lines on a map.

2888
03:08:03,280 --> 03:08:05,760
We're adding people, infrastructure demands,

2889
03:08:05,760 --> 03:08:09,360
and long-term obligations that outlast any single vote.

2890
03:08:09,360 --> 03:08:11,840
Residents deserve to see the math

2891
03:08:11,840 --> 03:08:14,720
before decisions are finalized, not after.

2892
03:08:16,720 --> 03:08:19,680
And if we're inviting newcomers to the Star of Alabama,

2893
03:08:19,680 --> 03:08:22,040
we should welcome them as Huntsvillians.

2894
03:08:22,040 --> 03:08:24,580
But we also cannot forget the people

2895
03:08:24,580 --> 03:08:27,180
who already built their lives here.

2896
03:08:27,180 --> 03:08:29,540
Developers benefiting from our growth

2897
03:08:29,540 --> 03:08:31,940
should be held to their commitments.

2898
03:08:31,940 --> 03:08:34,780
Growth should not leave residents and taxpayers

2899
03:08:34,780 --> 03:08:38,420
carrying the consequences, because ultimately,

2900
03:08:38,420 --> 03:08:40,780
this comes back to representation.

2901
03:08:41,780 --> 03:08:45,260
No elected official, no candidate, no institution

2902
03:08:45,260 --> 03:08:47,820
is above the voters.

2903
03:08:47,820 --> 03:08:51,140
The polling place belongs to the voters.

2904
03:08:53,040 --> 03:08:55,280
City Hall belongs to the people.

2905
03:08:56,320 --> 03:09:00,320
And public office belongs to the people,

2906
03:09:00,320 --> 03:09:04,120
not the person temporarily entrusted with it.

2907
03:09:04,120 --> 03:09:07,680
Huntsville has grown tremendously.

2908
03:09:07,680 --> 03:09:10,160
Now our representation, accountability,

2909
03:09:10,160 --> 03:09:12,640
and capacity have to grow with it.

2910
03:09:12,640 --> 03:09:14,640
I'll give you back your time, thank you.

2911
03:09:14,640 --> 03:09:19,640
Thank you, and finally, we will hear from Harold Kemp.

2912
03:09:19,740 --> 03:09:21,300
Is Mr. Kemp still here?

2913
03:09:22,800 --> 03:09:24,960
He is not, that was our last speaker.

2914
03:09:24,960 --> 03:09:27,600
Then do we have a motion to adjourn?

2915
03:09:27,600 --> 03:09:29,680
Motion for Mr. Little, thank you.

2916
03:09:29,680 --> 03:09:30,720
Thank you, council members.

2917
03:09:30,720 --> 03:09:32,840
We'll see you for the work session

2918
03:09:32,840 --> 03:09:34,800
on September 18th at 11 o'clock.
